Destroy armor will add 1-3 levels of deterioration to a particular piece
of armor if you don't have MR; it will add only 1 level if you do.  If
it targets a piece of armor that is "thoroughly" fubar (ie. already has
3 levels), that piece will be destroyed.

Destroy armor removes fooproofing and can affect normally undamageable
items such as the shield of reflection and DSM.  However, it is still
the only thing which will affect those.

